# 1Password secret references, resolved by `op run` (see README). Copy to .env.op and point at your items.
# Format: op://<vault>/<item>/<field> (names or IDs). Login items keep the secret in `password`; API Credential items in `credential`.
# No secret values belong in this file.
# Slack user token (xoxp-…) with reactions:read, channels:history, groups:history, im:history, mpim:history, users:read
SLACK_USER_TOKEN=op://Private/workflow-slack/password
# Linear personal API key
LINEAR_API_KEY=op://Private/workflow-linear/password
# Optional overrides (plain values are passed through unchanged)
# WORKFLOW_DB=data/workflow.db
# WORKFLOW_CONFIG=workflow.config.yaml
